UnityPy 1.25.2 and UnityPyBoost
https://github.com/K0lb3/UnityPy
Licence: MIT.

unityrs-core ports the read and write rules of UnityPy 1.25.2 and of the
UnityPyBoost C++ extension shipped in the same release, and unityrs-tpk
ports UnityPy 1.25.2's UnityPy/helpers/Tpk.py (how a type-tree package is
read and a class's type tree picked from it). A ported file names its UnityPy source in
its header and cites lines of that release. The tables in
crates/unityrs-core/src/classid.rs and
crates/unityrs-core/src/typetree/commonstring.rs are generated from
UnityPy 1.25.2's MIT source (UnityPy.enums.ClassIDType and
UnityPy.enums.CommonString) by tools/gen/gen_tables.py.

